                    "string": "{prep_date}",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "BiggerText",
                        "text_alignment": "right"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Re: QUALITY IMPROVEMENT OPPORTUNITY",
                    "text_style": {
                        "fontName": "Times-New-Roman-bold",
                        "parent_style": "BiggerText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Dear {provider_full_name},",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "The Michigan Department of Health and Human Services is committed to providing quality and evidence-based pharmacy services to behavioral health patients. In an effort to collaborate and assist you in providing safe, appropriate, and cost-effective care to your patients, we have implemented the Magellan <b>Whole Health Rx Consultation Program</b>. As part of this program, drug utilization algorithms based on evidence based guidelines are used to identify any potential drug therapy concerns.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "This letter has been generated because we have identified a member-specific quality opportunity. Please review the clinical information at the top of each page and the corresponding patient list to determine if a change in therapy can be made.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "borderColor": "#000000",
                        "borderPadding": [
                            6.0,
                            8.0,
                            6.0,
                            8.0
                        ],
                        "borderWidth": 1.0,
                        "fontName": "Times-New-Roman-bold",
                        "leftIndent": 32.0,
                        "parent_style": "BiggerText",
                        "rightIndent": 32.0,
                        "text_align": "center"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "This program is informational in nature and is not intended to replace your authority, responsibility, or accountability for patient care.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "A clinical pharmacist may contact you to schedule a consultation or come to your office to meet with you to discuss how the information can be used to improve the quality of care and reduce the risks of adverse events. You can also use the contact information below to contact a clinical pharmacist to request a personal consultation, provide feedback, ask questions, or request additional data.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Email: pharmacyconsultation@magellanhealth.com<br/>Phone: (800) 243-3771",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "All patients listed in this document have received a paid prescription with your national identification number (NPI) identified as the prescriber. Please be aware some of these patients may have received a prescription from you at a different site of service as this mailing is directed to the address primarily associated with your DEA.",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Sincerely,",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "image": {
                    "filename": "/images/signature_trish_bouck.png",
                    "height": 32.0
                }
            },
            {
                "paragraph": {
                    "string": "Trish M. Bouck, MPA, RN<br/>Director, Pharmacy Management Division<br/>Bureau of Medicaid Care Management & Quality Assurance<br/>Medical Services Administration<br/>Michigan Department of Health and Human Services cc: Enclosure",
                    "text_style": {
                        "parent_style": "ParagraphText"
                    }
                }
            }
